msgid "Ryuuji「（Shit...... I was out like a light!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Mierda...... ¡Me quedé dormido＿como un tronco!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Am I that cold-hearted? Taiga was＿saying that I \"talked about it like it's＿not my problem.\"）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Tan frío soy? Taiga decía que \"hablaba＿como si no fuera problema mío\".）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（But I want to support Kitamura......＿*Sigh*）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Pero quiero apoyar a Kitamura......＿*Suspiro*）」"

msgid "Yasuko「Wh......ere...... is......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Dó......nde...... está......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, you're already awake, Yasuko?＿You can go back to sleep, you know.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, ya estás despierta, Yasuko?＿Puedes volver a dormir, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Yasuko「......the FOOOOOOD～?!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......¡la COMIDAAAAA～?!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Don't smell...... the rice......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No huelo...... el arroz......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How could I have forgotten to switch＿on the rice cooker?! Hang on, I'll get it＿cooking in the clay pot at once!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Cómo pude olvidar encender la＿arrocera?! ¡Espera, lo pongo en＿la olla de barro enseguida!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan forgot the riceee～＿Ryuu-chan is brokennnn～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan olvidó el arroooz～＿Ryuu-chan está rotooo～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'm not broken, I just skipped a＿step.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no estoy roto, solo＿me salté un paso.」"

msgid "Yasuko「So you ARE broken～ Sniff, waaah,＿Ryuu-cha...... Ryuu-chan is...... Ryuu......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Entonces SÍ estás roto～ Snif,＿buaaah, Ryuu-cha...... Ryuu-chan＿está...... Ryuu......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Zzzzzz.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Zzzzzz.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, don't fall asleep on me! At least＿cover yourself first! Your panties are＿showing!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, ¡no te quedes dormida! ¡Al＿menos tápate primero! ¡¡Se te＿ve la ropa interior!!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Teehee～...... Ryuu-chan's so nice～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Jiji～...... Qué amable es Ryuu-chan～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Smiling with her panties on display......＿T-This is bad......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Sonriendo con la ropa interior a la＿vista...... ¡E-Esto es malo......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「L-Let me just cover that up for you......＿Ohh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「D-Déjame taparte eso...... ¡¿Ehh?!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Huuuh? Ryuu-chan, your face is all＿red～ What's wronggg?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Eeeh? Ryuu-chan, tienes la cara＿toda roja～ ¿Qué pasaaa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Gosh①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Cielos①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So I resemble my papa...... papa......＿PAPAAA!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que me parezco a mi papá......＿papá...... ¡¿PAPÁAA?!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Sorry for the waittt. ① This is your＿papa.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Perdón por la esperaaa.＿① Este es tu papá.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Ugh......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Ugh......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Now I understand why Yasuko and I＿look nothing alike......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ahora entiendo por qué Yasuko y yo＿no nos parecemos en nada......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yasuko...... You haven't changed a bit＿since this photo was taken......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yasuko...... No has cambiado nada desde＿que tomaron esta foto......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh my ☆ Thanksss～!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Oh, vaya ☆ ¡Graciasss～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just for future reference...... How old＿are you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo como referencia......＿¿Cuántos años tienes?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Gosh, since Ryuu-chan is so good at＿flattery, here it is～ Yacchan is＿thir～ty～three～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ay, como Ryuu-chan es tan bueno＿para los halagos, ahí va～ Yacchan＿tiene trein～ta y～tres～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Thirty......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Treinta......!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, what's wrong? Did you get＿even more brokennn?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, ¿qué pasa? ¿Te＿rompiste todavía másss?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, you just blew my mind right＿now...... So, where's my old man?＿Haven't seen him around......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, me dejaste sin palabras......＿¿Dónde está mi padre? No lo he＿visto por aquí......」"

msgid "Yasuko「............」"
msgstr "Yasuko「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm?」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Wellll, Papa is far, FAR awayyy～＿He's watching over Ryuu-chan and＿Yacchannn～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......Buenooo, papá está muy,＿MUY lejosss～ Él está cuidando＿a Ryuu-chan y a Yacchannn～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Nyaha! Gotta put this photo backkk①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Ñaja! Tengo que guardar esta fotooo①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What a horrible question to ask...... I'm＿sure there are circumstances as to＿why my old man is gone......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Qué pregunta más terrible hice......＿Seguro hay razones por las que＿ya no está......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hmm, Yasuko's sure taking her time.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Mmm, Yasuko sí que tarda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Good grief.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Qué barbaridad.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Mmmm～ ......Nnngg...... Ryuu-channn......＿Nnngg......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Mmmm～ ......Mmmg...... Ryuu-channn......＿Mmmg......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sheesh, fast asleep......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vaya, profundamente dormida......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Yasuko「Zzzz...... Zzzz......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Zzzz...... Zzzz......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What if they felt the same way, but＿neither of you could own up to it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y si sintieran lo mismo, pero ninguno＿de los dos pudiera admitirlo?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Zzzz...... Zzzz......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Zzzz...... Zzzz......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Would you want me to help pair you＿up? Do you think that I should?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Querrías que ayudara a juntarlos?＿¿Crees que debería hacerlo?」"

msgid "Yasuko「About thattt--」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Sobre esooo--」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh! If you're awake, don't startle me＿like that!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Eh! ¡Si estás despierta,＿no me asustes así!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Isn't it something only they can＿decideee?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿No es algo que solo ellos＿pueden decidirrr?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Yasuko「Zzzz...... Zzzz......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Zzzz...... Zzzz......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry for asking these weird＿questions...... Sleep tight.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón por hacer preguntas tan＿raras...... Que descanses.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, phone's ringing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está sonando el teléfono.」"

msgid "Ami「......Just a reminder: meet in front of＿Sudoh-Bucks. See ya.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Solo un recordatorio: es frente＿a Sudoh-Bucks. Nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now then, what to do......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y bien, ¿qué hacer......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I was supposed to think about the＿situation between Kitamura and Kanou＿Sumire, but......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Se suponía que debía pensar en＿la situación entre Kitamura y＿Kanou Sumire, pero......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Morning came before I knew it......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Amaneció antes de que me＿diera cuenta......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No, it's not like I was doing it on＿purpose. However...... Maybe my＿amnesia is to blame.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No, no es que lo hiciera a propósito.＿Sin embargo...... Tal vez la culpa＿sea de mi amnesia.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（These unfolding circumstances just＿aren't sinking in......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Todo lo que está pasando aún no me＿termina de entrar en la cabeza......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Right here. The rolled omelettes are＿plump and glossy, the miso soup was＿made from scratch......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aquí está. Las tortillas enrolladas＿quedaron esponjosas, la sopa de＿miso es casera......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And the rice...... *Gasp*!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y el arroz...... ¡Ah!」"

msgid "Yasuko「That gruffness...... The more you＿resemble your papa, the cooler you＿gettt. ① Yacchan's heart skipped a」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Esa rudeza...... Mientras más te＿pareces a tu papá, más genial te＿ponesss. ① A Yacchan le dio un」"

msgid "Yasuko「beattt.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「vuelcooo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「That's righttt. ① Huh? Ryuu-chan has＿yet to see Papa's photo since the＿amnesiaaa? How careless～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Es ciertooo. ① ¿Eh? ¿Ryuu-chan no＿ha visto la foto de papá desde la＿amnesiaaa? Qué descuido～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Wait right here, be right back, gansu♪」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Espera aquí, ya vuelvo, gansu♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Papa...... So in other words, Yasuko is＿my mother? This babyface, who looks＿nothing like me, is my mother!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Papá...... ¿Yasuko es mi madre?＿¡¿Esta cara de niña, que no se parece＿a mí, es mi madre?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（So this means I saw my own mother's＿panties...... Fuck my life.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Entonces eso significa que vi la＿ropa interior de mi propia madre......＿Qué mierda de vida.）」"

msgid "Yasuko「Heyyy, Ryuu-chan should get this＿hairstyle～ And an open-collared＿shirttt, and a gold chainnn.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Oyeee, Ryuu-chan debería hacerse este＿peinado～ Una camisa con el cuello＿abiertooo y una cadena de orooo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Bonus points for gold front teeth. ☆＿Oh my～ So cool～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Puntos extra por dientes frontales de＿oro. ☆ Oh, cielos～ Qué genial～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（How long has he been out of the＿picture? Don't tell me Yasuko raised＿me all on her own......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Cuánto tiempo lleva ausente?＿¿Acaso Yasuko me crio completamente＿sola......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Looking at it from this perspective,＿she's been through a lot.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Viéndolo desde esta perspectiva,＿ha pasado por mucho.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you ended up going back to bed......＿Come on, your panties are showing＿again!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que terminaste volviendo a＿la cama...... ¡Vamos, se te vuelve＿a ver la ropa interior!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And the photo will get dusty if you＿leave it out like that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y la foto se va a empolvar＿si la dejas ahí así.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Here's a hypothetical question. If＿you had been rejected by your＿crush......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Una pregunta hipotética.＿Si te hubiera rechazado la persona＿que te gusta......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What if, while you were trying to forget＿them, you saw them right in front of＿you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué harías si, mientras intentas＿olvidarla, la ves justo frente a ti?」"
